{"n": 362, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "362.webp", "text": "lene!\n\n| 30-39 007\n\n21-5\n\n2152000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nCLUTCH MASTER CYLINDER\n\n‘Disconnect line (1) to slave cylinder,\n\nUnscrew cap on fluid tank,\n\nRemove float container (2),\n\nDraw off brake fluid in tank to drop level to\nconnection for filling line,\n\nDetach instrument panel trim at bottom left\n\n— see 51 45 180.\n\nDetach piston rod (3) on clutch pedal.\n“fnstallation\n\nAdjust clutch pedal with eccentric bolt (7)\n\n— see Group 35,\n\nImportant! — Installation\n\nVersion with Over-Center Helper Spring:\nEngage over-center helper spring (8) in guide\ntab (9) on pedal base prior 15 installation of\npiston rod (3),\n\n2021007\n\nPull ows filling tine (4).\nUnscrew bolts (5 and 6).\nRemove master cylinder\nInstallation:\n\nBleed clutch — see 21 00 006.\n\n2152010 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nCLUTCH SLAVE CYLINDER\n\nUnscrew cap on fluid tank.\n\nRemove float container (2).\n\nDraw off brake fluid in tank to drop level to\nconnection for filling line\n\nDetach slave cylinder on tranumisnon.\nRemove slave cylinder.\n\nDisconnect line (3).\n\nNote:\n\nInstall a 22.2 mm dia. slave cylinder (instead of\n20.64 mm dia.) in cars with a double mass\nflywheel to prevent touching of the release\nlever when the clutch pedal is floored (also\nrefer to Service Information of Group 21),\nJastaliatian:\n\nBleeder screw faces down.\n\nInstall front push rod with Molykete\nLongterm 2.\n\nBleed clutch 27 00 006.", "words": [["lene!", 0.2285, 0.0694, 0.2396, 0.0787], ["|", 0.178, 0.9524, 0.179, 0.9537], ["30-39", 0.186, 0.9537, 0.2093, 0.9616], ["007", 0.2133, 0.9537, 0.2305, 0.9616], ["21-5", 0.4611, 0.0271, 0.5137, 0.0509], ["2152000", 0.2624, 0.0628, 0.3109, 0.0747], ["REMOVING", 0.3251, 0.0642, 0.3847, 0.0747], ["AND", 0.3888, 0.0642, 0.4135, 0.0747], ["INSTALLING", 0.4176, 0.0642, 0.4843, 0.0747], ["CLUTCH", 0.3241, 0.08, 0.3686, 0.0906], ["MASTER", 0.3726, 0.08, 0.4176, 0.0906], ["CYLINDER", 0.4216, 0.08